From: Kaixin Liu <liukaixin1@h-partners.com>
Date: Thu, 6 Aug 2026 16:19:42 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 05/11] feat(cpu): add fused SDPA flash2 L3KV implementation

- sdpa_common.h: shared types/consts for the fused fp32_packqkv SDPA path
- sdpa_flash2_neon_l3kv_impl.h: flash2-style NEON kernel with a packed
  L3 KV cache layout (mask_f16 / mask_f32 / maskless variants)
- sdpa_pack_utils.h / sdpa_tile_sizes.h: QKV packing helpers and tile sizing
- sdpa_profile.h: optional per-kernel profiling counters
- sdpa_standalone_shim.h: standalone-entry shim for the kernel
